OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over assault
OL,4,Ainvolving bladed weapon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after an
OL,7,Faltercation in York which involved a
OL,8,Fbladed weapon.
OL,10,FNorth Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to the Leeman Road area at
OL,12,F14:19 BST on Sunday regarding a fight
OL,13,Finvolving three men.
OL,15,FTwo men were found injured at the scene
OL,16,Fand were taken to hospital for
OL,17,Ftreatment. The force said their
OL,18,Finjuries were not believed to be
OL,19,Flife-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
