OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over assault
OL,4,Ainvolving bladed weapon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said an extensive search
OL,7,Finvolving armed officers and police dog
OL,8,Funits was launched for the third man.
OL,9,FThe man was later arrested on suspicion
OL,10,Fof serious assault and possession of an
OL,11,Foffensive weapon at Hull Railway
OL,12,FStation.
